File: contrib/dbs/xtiff/xtiff.c
Line: 762
Function: GetTIFFImage
Bug type: integer-overflow-to-heap-buffer-overflow
CWE: CWE-190
Explanation: The allocation size tfImageWidth * tfImageHeight * 4 can overflow 32-bit arithmetic, leading to a too-small buffer from malloc. Subsequent loops write 4 bytes per pixel for tfImageWidth * tfImageHeight pixels, overflowing the heap buffer.

